message: "If you use this software, model weights, or research findings, please cite it as below."
title: "Failure-Targeted Contrastive Augmentation for Low-Resource Claim Verification"
abstract: "We investigate whether directing a fixed synthetic-data budget toward observed verifier errors improves low-resource claim verification. We evaluate three-way claim verification with 935 organizer-supplied training pairs and four Gemma-4-12B QLoRA conditions under matched optimization budgets. Accepted at the 7th International Conference on Innovative Computing (ICIC 2026), IEEE."
